# Requests you can send from Visual Studio: open this file and click "Send request" above a request.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Supported currencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reference/currencies

### Unknown route -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/does-not-exist

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
